1
00:00:00,145 --> 00:00:07,249
Part 7 mein pharmaceutical companies, principals aur suppliers dekhenge: company jodna,

2
00:00:07,249 --> 00:00:12,801
stockist agreement, supplier profile, credit terms, supplier ledger,

3
00:00:12,801 --> 00:00:15,741
outstanding aur supplier ko payment.

4
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:20,343
Masters mein Companies and principals kholiye.

5
00:00:20,343 --> 00:00:25,415
Is screen par teen cheezein hain: companies yaani manufacturers,

6
00:00:25,415 --> 00:00:30,884
principals yaani unke saath aapke stockist agreements, aur suppliers,

7
00:00:30,884 --> 00:00:33,182
jinse aap maal kharidte hain.

8
00:00:33,853 --> 00:00:40,468
Saari companies aur supplier names fictional hain, jinke aage Demo likha hai.

9
00:00:40,468 --> 00:00:48,115
Nayi company jodte hain: Add company kholiye, naam Kavach Demo Pharma, short name KAVACH,

10
00:00:48,115 --> 00:00:49,833
aur contact details.

11
00:00:50,485 --> 00:00:58,030
Principal ka matlab hai company ke saath aapka agreement: kis supplier ya C and F se maal

12
00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:03,541
aata hai, aapka margin, divisions, aur expiry return ki shartein,

13
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:11,001
jaise expiry se 90 din pehle se 180 din baad tak claim, aur kitne percent credit milega.

14
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:14,573
Yeh expiry terms bahut zaroori hain.

15
00:01:14,573 --> 00:01:20,236
Medoro inhi se tay karta hai ki koi batch claim ke laayak hai ya nahi,

16
00:01:20,236 --> 00:01:23,229
aur kitna credit milne ki ummeed hai.

17
00:01:23,229 --> 00:01:27,760
Isliye har company ke principal mein sahi terms bhariye.

18
00:01:28,415 --> 00:01:33,504
Neeche suppliers ki list hai: GSTIN, credit days, lead time,

19
00:01:33,504 --> 00:01:38,933
expiry returns lete hain ya nahi, aur ab ek naya column, We owe,

20
00:01:38,933 --> 00:01:42,835
yaani hum is supplier ko kitna dene wale hain.

21
00:01:43,489 --> 00:01:50,758
Naya supplier jodne ke liye Add supplier kholiye: naam, GSTIN, phone, credit days,

22
00:01:50,758 --> 00:01:54,747
lead time, return window aur opening balance.

23
00:01:54,747 --> 00:02:00,597
Doosre state ka GSTIN ho toh purchase par IGST apne-aap lagta hai.

24
00:02:01,266 --> 00:02:07,199
Ab kisi supplier par click kariye, jaise Aarogya Demo C and F Agency.

25
00:02:07,199 --> 00:02:13,304
Yeh supplier ka ledger page hai: hum kitna dene wale hain, credit days,

26
00:02:13,304 --> 00:02:16,142
aakhri kharid aur aakhri payment.

27
00:02:16,795 --> 00:02:22,162
Ledger statement mein har GRN credit mein aata hai, aur har payment,

28
00:02:22,162 --> 00:02:25,397
debit note ya claim ka credit debit mein.

29
00:02:25,397 --> 00:02:29,659
Running balance batata hai ki kis din kitna baaki tha.

30
00:02:29,659 --> 00:02:33,447
Date range chun kar statement nikaal sakte hain.

31
00:02:34,108 --> 00:02:39,404
Supplier ko payment dene ke liye Pay supplier mein amount, mode,

32
00:02:39,404 --> 00:02:42,135
aur UTR ya cheque number bhariye.

33
00:02:42,135 --> 00:02:45,114
Hum 50,000 rupaye NEFT se dete hain.

34
00:02:45,114 --> 00:02:52,728
Record payment dabaate hi payment voucher banta hai aur sabse purane bill pehle chukte hain.

35
00:02:53,379 --> 00:02:57,878
Payment post ho gaya, aur We owe ka aankda kam ho gaya.

36
00:02:57,878 --> 00:03:02,867
Neeche statement mein naya payment voucher bhi dikh raha hai.

37
00:03:02,867 --> 00:03:07,775
Recent GRNs mein is supplier se aaye saare maal ki list hai.

38
00:03:08,422 --> 00:03:14,242
Yeh supplier ledger aur payment screen is project ki QA ke dauraan banaya gaya,

39
00:03:14,242 --> 00:03:20,872
kyunki pehle Distribution mein supplier ka outstanding sirf trial balance mein ek total ki

40
00:03:20,872 --> 00:03:22,124
tarah dikhta tha.

41
00:03:22,124 --> 00:03:25,218
Ab har supplier ka hisaab alag dikhta hai.
